&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with internal teams (e.g. Deal Desk, Product Management, Customer Success, Finance, Legal) to provide compliant, proactive solutions based on the customer&#39;s installed SKUs, Product Roadmap, and their unique Digital Transformation journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
