&lt;p&gt;SpaceX is seeking to add a tax analyst to work on U.S. and local country tax matters for SpaceX subsidiaries worldwide as we expand our Starlink business. The tax analyst will be part of the international tax team located in Hawthorne, CA.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
