&lt;li&gt;Collaborate and partner with cross-functional teams (operations, commercial, legal, customs, treasury, accounting, finance) and other stakeholders to build a strong network across these departments and with external resources to ensure compliance with local legislation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;markaibuvu5un&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;tax&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;payments, including monitoring payment dates, calculating correct payment amounts, and ensuring payments are properly recorded in the books&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with maintaining&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;markaibuvu5un&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;tax&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;records, legal agreements, customs, and transfer pricing documentation&lt;/li&gt;
