&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in&amp;nbsp;accounting or&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;markaibuvu5un&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience at Big 4 accounting firm or multinational companies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;Understanding of e-invoicing&amp;nbsp;requirements&amp;nbsp;and VAT/GST&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated understanding of indirect&amp;nbsp;&lt;span class=&quot;markaibuvu5un&quot; data-markjs=&quot;true&quot; data-ogac=&quot;&quot; data-ogab=&quot;&quot; data-ogsc=&quot;&quot; data-ogsb=&quot;&quot;&gt;tax&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;compliance for digital services, satellite communications, or imported hardware in multiple jurisdictions&lt;/li&gt;
